Output mods/huh/preview.gif
Source demo/style.tape
Set Height 800
Source demo/session.tape
Set Framerate 24

Hide
Type `cd "$OMODS_PROJECT" && claude --plugin-dir "$OMODS_ROOT/mods/huh"`
Enter
Wait+Screen@40s /mode on/
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+L
Show
Sleep 1s
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Type "why is checkout slow?"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
Type "/huh"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
Hide
Ctrl+C
Ctrl+C
